# Write your MySQL query statement below

This query finds customers who visited but did not make any transaction.
It left joins visits with transactions
Filters rows where no matching transaction exists
Groups by customer_id
Counts how many such visits each customer had
----------------------------------------------------------------------
SELECT customer_id,
COUNT(*) AS count_no_trans
FROM visits v
LEFT JOIN transactions t
ON v.visit_id=t.visit_id
WHERE t.visit_id IS NULL
GROUP BY v.customer_id;
